{"seq":3,"slug":"treasury-yield-efficiency-kpi","title":"资金归集率/融资成本/收益率度量","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/global-treasury-cash-pooling/treasury-risk-metric/treasury-yield-efficiency-kpi","wordCount":2312,"readingTime":10,"html":"<h1 id=\"资金归集率-融资成本-收益率度量\">资金归集率/融资成本/收益率度量</h1><p>资金池建起来之后，管理层一定会问三个问题：有多少钱真的归集起来了、集团为钱付出的总成本是多少、闲置的钱赚回来多少。这三个问题对应三个指标族——<strong>归集率、融资成本、收益率</strong>。它们单独看都可以被优化，合起来看才反映司库的真实水平：归集率可以靠强制归集刷高，融资成本可以靠少融资刷低，收益率可以靠拉长久期刷高，三者互相欺骗。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>度量体系的设计原则是<strong>让指标之间存在约束关系</strong>，使得单点优化必然在别处付出代价，从而迫使管理动作回到整体最优。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[司库度量] --&gt; B[归集率 覆盖率指标]&#10;    A --&gt; C[融资成本 价格指标]&#10;    A --&gt; D[收益率 产出指标]&#10;    B --&gt; E[有效归集余额 / 可归集余额]&#10;    C --&gt; F[加权平均融资成本 WACF]&#10;    C --&gt; G[净债务成本]&#10;    D --&gt; H[净贡献收益率]&#10;    D --&gt; I[超额收益 vs 基准]&#10;    B --&gt; J[约束: 归集率高但缓冲不能过低]&#10;    C --&gt; K[约束: 成本低但不能牺牲流动性]&#10;    D --&gt; L[约束: 收益高但不能拉长久期]\">graph TD\n    A[司库度量] --&gt; B[归集率 覆盖率指标]\n    A --&gt; C[融资成本 价格指标]\n    A --&gt; D[收益率 产出指标]\n    B --&gt; E[有效归集余额 / 可归集余额]\n    C --&gt; F[加权平均融资成本 WACF]\n    C --&gt; G[净债务成本]\n    D --&gt; H[净贡献收益率]\n    D --&gt; I[超额收益 vs 基准]\n    B --&gt; J[约束: 归集率高但缓冲不能过低]\n    C --&gt; K[约束: 成本低但不能牺牲流动性]\n    D --&gt; L[约束: 收益高但不能拉长久期]</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>指标族</th>\n<th>核心指标</th>\n<th>单点优化陷阱</th>\n<th>平衡约束</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>归集率</td>\n<td>有效归集率</td>\n<td>强制归集挤占成员营运资金</td>\n<td>成员最低留存不得被侵占</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>融资成本</td>\n<td>加权平均融资成本</td>\n<td>少融资导致流动性不足</td>\n<td>覆盖天数不得低于下限</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>收益率</td>\n<td>净贡献收益率</td>\n<td>拉长久期换取高收益</td>\n<td>期限分层限额与 WAM/WAL 上限</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>度量口径必须与会计口径对齐，否则管理指标与报表数字会长期背离。会计上&quot;现金及现金等价物&quot;的定义是：&quot;现金&quot;指库存现金与活期存款；&quot;现金等价物&quot;是&quot;短期、高度流动、易于转换为已知金额现金、且价值变动风险很小&quot;的投资；现金流量表则按经营、投资、融资三类活动分类（见 <a href=\"https://www.ifrs.org/issued-standards/list-of-standards/ias-7-statement-of-cash-flows/\">IFRS Foundation 对 IAS 7 的说明</a>）。这意味着司库口中的&quot;可用资金&quot;与报表上的&quot;现金及现金等价物&quot;并不等同：前者含可在压力下快速变现但不满足现金等价物条件的资产，后者不含受限资金。度量归集率与收益率时若不显式说明所采用的口径，管理层看到的数字与审计看到的数字会对不上。</p>\n<h2 id=\"归集率的定义与陷阱\">归集率的定义与陷阱</h2><h3 id=\"三个归集率口径\">三个归集率口径</h3><p><strong>名义归集率</strong> = 已纳入资金池的账户余额 / 全部账户余额。它只反映&quot;接进来了多少&quot;，不反映&quot;归集是否有效&quot;。</p>\n<p><strong>有效归集率</strong> = 日终实际归集到主账户的余额 / 可归集余额。可归集余额要扣掉受监管限制、受担保质押、以及成员维持经营所需的最低留存。这个口径才是司库真正应该考核的。</p>\n<p><strong>净额化比率</strong> = 归集后集团外部净头寸 / 归集前各成员外部头寸之和。它直接反映归集消除了多少&quot;同时存款又借款&quot;的浪费。</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>R</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">_</mi><mtext>net</mtext><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><munder><mo>∑</mo><mi>i</mi></munder><mtext>ExternalPosition</mtext><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">_</mi><msup><mi>i</mi><mtext>after</mtext></msup></mrow><mrow><munder><mo>∑</mo><mi>i</mi></munder><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">∣</mo><mtext>ExternalPosition</mtext><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">_</mi><msup><mi>i</mi><mtext>before</mtext></msup><mo fence=\"true\">∣</mo></mrow></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">R\\_{\\text{net}} = \\frac{\\sum_i \\text{ExternalPosition}\\_i^{\\text{after}}}{\\sum_i \\left|\\text{ExternalPosition}\\_i^{\\text{before}}\\right|}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9933em;vertical-align:-0.31em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"mord\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">_</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">net</span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.6391em;vertical-align:-1.09em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.5491em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.26em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop op-symbol small-op\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∑</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.162em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4003em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2997em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen\"><span class=\"delimsizing mult\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.85em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.85em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.2em;\"></span><span style=\"width:0.333em;height:1.2em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"0.333em\" height=\"1.2em\" viewBox=\"0 0 333 1200\"><path d=\"M145 15 v585 v0 v585 c2.667,10,9.667,15,21,15\nc10,0,16.667,-5,20,-15 v-585 v0 v-585 c-2.667,-10,-9.667,-15,-21,-15\nc-10,0,-16.667,5,-20,15z M188 15 H145 v585 v0 v585 h43z\"/></svg></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.35em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">ExternalPosition</span></span><span class=\"mord\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">_</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7751em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.989em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">before</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\"><span class=\"delimsizing mult\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.85em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.85em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.2em;\"></span><span style=\"width:0.333em;height:1.2em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"0.333em\" height=\"1.2em\" viewBox=\"0 0 333 1200\"><path d=\"M145 15 v585 v0 v585 c2.667,10,9.667,15,21,15\nc10,0,16.667,-5,20,-15 v-585 v0 v-585 c-2.667,-10,-9.667,-15,-21,-15\nc-10,0,-16.667,5,-20,15z M188 15 H145 v585 v0 v585 h43z\"/></svg></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.35em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.7em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop op-symbol small-op\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∑</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.162em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4003em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2997em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">ExternalPosition</span></span><span class=\"mord\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">_</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8491em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">after</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.09em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>这个比率越低越好——它意味着集团内部的资金对冲得越充分。它同时也是<a href=\"../position-netting-liquidity/multicurrency-position-netting\">多币种头寸与双边/多边净额</a>与<a href=\"../cash-pool-structure/physical-vs-notional-pooling\">实体归集 vs 名义资金池</a>结构选择的最终效果度量。</p>\n<h3 id=\"归集率的常见失真\">归集率的常见失真</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>失真</th>\n<th>成因</th>\n<th>识别方式</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>虚高</td>\n<td>分母未扣受限资金</td>\n<td>核对受限资金台账</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>虚高</td>\n<td>强制归集侵占经营资金</td>\n<td>成员端出现频繁日间透支</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>虚低</td>\n<td>部分账户未接入系统</td>\n<td>账户台账与池内账户清单比对</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>虚低</td>\n<td>归集时点早于实际可用</td>\n<td>对比归集时点与清算完成时点</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>第二种失真最危险：归集率高但成员被迫日间透支，说明归集率是靠侵占经营资金换来的，成员会在池外另开户规避。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"WITH acct AS (&#10;  SELECT p.account_id, p.entity_code, p.currency,&#10;         p.poolable_balance,&#10;         COALESCE(p.restricted_balance, 0)  AS restricted_balance,&#10;         COALESCE(p.min_operating_balance, 0) AS min_operating_balance,&#10;         COALESCE(s.swept_amount, 0)        AS swept_amount&#10;  FROM pool_account_daily p&#10;  LEFT JOIN sweep_result s&#10;         ON s.account_id = p.account_id AND s.value_date = p.as_of&#10;  WHERE p.as_of = DATE &#39;2026-09-28&#39;&#10;)&#10;SELECT currency,&#10;       SUM(poolable_balance)                                    AS total_poolable,&#10;       SUM(restricted_balance + min_operating_balance)           AS excluded,&#10;       SUM(poolable_balance - restricted_balance - min_operating_balance)&#10;                                                                 AS available_for_sweep,&#10;       SUM(swept_amount)                                         AS actually_swept,&#10;       ROUND(SUM(swept_amount)&#10;             / NULLIF(SUM(poolable_balance - restricted_balance - min_operating_balance), 0)&#10;             , 4)                                                AS effective_sweep_rate&#10;FROM acct&#10;GROUP BY currency&#10;ORDER BY effective_sweep_rate ASC;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WITH</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> acct </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> p</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">account_id</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">p</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">entity_code</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">p</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">currency</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">         p</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">poolable_balance</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">         COALESCE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">p</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">restricted_balance</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)  </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> restricted_balance,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">         COALESCE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">p</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">min_operating_balance</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> min_operating_balance,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">         COALESCE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">s</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">swept_amount</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)        </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> swept_amount</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> pool_account_daily p</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  LEFT JOIN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> sweep_result s</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">         ON</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> s</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">account_id</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> p</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">account_id</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> AND</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> s</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">value_date</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> p</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">as_of</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> p</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">as_of</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> DATE</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> '2026-09-28'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> currency,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">       SUM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(poolable_balance)                                    </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> total_poolable,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">       SUM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(restricted_balance </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> min_operating_balance)           </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> excluded,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">       SUM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(poolable_balance </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> restricted_balance </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> min_operating_balance)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">                                                                 AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> available_for_sweep,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">       SUM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(swept_amount)                                         </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> actually_swept,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">       ROUND</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">SUM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(swept_amount)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">             /</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> NULLIF</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">SUM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(poolable_balance </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> restricted_balance </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> min_operating_balance), </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">             , </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">4</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)                                                </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> effective_sweep_rate</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> acct</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">GROUP BY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> currency</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">ORDER BY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> effective_sweep_rate </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">ASC</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>effective_sweep_rate</code> 就是有效归集率。按币种分别看很重要——单一币种的低归集率会被其他币种的高值掩盖。</p>\n<h2 id=\"融资成本的度量\">融资成本的度量</h2><h3 id=\"加权平均融资成本\">加权平均融资成本</h3><p>集团的融资成本不能简单用&quot;总利息 / 总债务&quot;，因为债务的币种、期限、工具结构差异很大。规范的度量是加权平均融资成本（WACF）：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>WACF</mtext><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><munder><mo>∑</mo><mi>j</mi></munder><msub><mi>D</mi><mi>j</mi></msub><mo>⋅</mo><msub><mi>r</mi><mi>j</mi></msub></mrow><mrow><munder><mo>∑</mo><mi>j</mi></munder><msub><mi>D</mi><mi>j</mi></msub></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{WACF} = \\frac{\\sum_j D_j \\cdot r_j}{\\sum_j D_j}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">WACF</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.6976em;vertical-align:-1.1218em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.5758em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop op-symbol small-op\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∑</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.162em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4003em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.4358em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.8258em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop op-symbol small-op\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∑</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.162em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4003em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.4358em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.1218em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>D</mi><mi>j</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">D_j</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 为第 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>j</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">j</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.854em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span></span></span></span></span> 笔债务的余额，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>r</mi><mi>j</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">r_j</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7167em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 为其实际利率。要得到可比结果，需注意三点：浮动利率债务要按当期重定价利率或按对冲后的实际成本计算；外币债务要么按原币分别计算、要么折算为集团功能货币后计算并注明汇率口径；费用（承诺费、安排费）应摊入实际成本而不仅计票面利率。</p>\n<h3 id=\"边际成本与平均成本\">边际成本与平均成本</h3><p>平均成本反映历史，<strong>边际成本反映当下</strong>。做新增融资决策时应看边际成本——集团现在再去市场上借一笔钱要付多少。当市场利率上行时，边际成本会先于平均成本上升，用平均成本做决策会低估新资金的实际代价。</p>\n<p>资金池的 FTP 曲线（见<a href=\"../intercompany-funding-transfer/fund-transfer-pricing-interest\">内部资金转移定价（FTP）与利息</a>）应当以边际成本为基准，而不是平均成本。</p>\n<h3 id=\"融资成本与流动性成本的合并\">融资成本与流动性成本的合并</h3><p>低融资成本可能来自&quot;少借短期、多留现金&quot;——但留现金本身有成本（机会成本，即闲置资金本可获得的收益）。度量总资金成本时应把两部分合并：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>C</mi><mo>∗</mo><mtext>total</mtext><mo>=</mo><mtext>WACF</mtext><mo>×</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>D</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\">‾</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mi>r</mi><mo>∗</mo><mtext>opportunity</mtext><mo>×</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mtext>IdleCash</mtext><mo stretchy=\"true\">‾</mo></mover></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C*{\\text{total}} = \\text{WACF} \\times \\overline{D} + r*{\\text{opportunity}} \\times \\overline{\\text{IdleCash}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">∗</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">total</span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">WACF</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord overline\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8833em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.8033em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"overline-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4653em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">∗</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8623em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">opportunity</span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord overline\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8944em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">IdleCash</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.8144em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"overline-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>只看 WACF 会奖励&quot;尽可能少借、尽可能多留现金&quot;的策略，而实际上现金的机会成本可能高于借款节省的利息。这个合并口径是防止融资成本指标被孤立优化的关键。</p>\n<h2 id=\"收益率的度量与归因\">收益率的度量与归因</h2><h3 id=\"净贡献收益率\">净贡献收益率</h3><p>闲置资金的收益率度量已在<a href=\"../position-netting-liquidity/shortterm-investment-yield\">短期投资与闲置资金收益</a>中给出净贡献收益率的定义：扣除交易成本与管理成本后的实际收益除以平均投资余额。这里补充它的<strong>归因方法</strong>。</p>\n<p>收益与基准的差额可拆成三部分：<strong>配置效应</strong>（在不同期限层之间的分配）、<strong>选择效应</strong>（在同类工具中选到高于平均的标的）、<strong>时机效应</strong>（买入时点相对利率走势的位置）。归因的价值在于区分&quot;能力&quot;与&quot;运气&quot;——时机效应为正往往不可持续。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>归因项</th>\n<th>含义</th>\n<th>可持续性</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>配置效应</td>\n<td>期限层分配偏离基准</td>\n<td>中，取决于对利率的判断</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>选择效应</td>\n<td>同类工具中选优</td>\n<td>高，反映谈判与筛选能力</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>时机效应</td>\n<td>买入时点</td>\n<td>低，接近随机</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"与流动性的联合判读\">与流动性的联合判读</h3><p>三个指标必须联合判读，单独看任何一个都会得出错误结论。下面这张表给出常见的组合与对应诊断：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>归集率</th>\n<th>融资成本</th>\n<th>收益率</th>\n<th>诊断</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>归集激进但外部融资仍贵，检查授信结构</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>资金充足但闲置过多，检查投资分层是否过保守</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>大量资金未归集，收益靠个别长头寸，风险高</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>池子形同虚设，需从账户与协议层重建</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>第三种组合是最危险的：归集率低意味着大量资金在体外，而高收益率说明体外资金被投向了较长久期的工具，一旦需要调度就会发现拿不回来。</p>\n<h2 id=\"度量体系的运行要求\">度量体系的运行要求</h2><h3 id=\"口径的一致性与可追溯\">口径的一致性与可追溯</h3><p>所有指标必须有书面口径，且口径变更需留痕并重述历史数据。司库指标最常出的问题不是算错，而是<strong>前后两期口径不同</strong>导致趋势不可比。指标应按固定频率发布（通常每日看归集率与头寸，每月看成本与收益），并附上与上期的差异归因。</p>\n<h3 id=\"与其他体系的衔接\">与其他体系的衔接</h3><p>融资成本与资本结构的关系、以及内部借贷的税务成本，属于<a href=\"../intercompany-funding-transfer/intercompany-loan-capitalization\">多实体内部借贷与资本弱化</a>处理的边界；收益率的上限受连带流动性约束，见<a href=\"liquidity-risk-contingency\">流动性风险与应急额度</a>。度量体系的作用是让这三者之间的取舍可见，而不是各自独立优化。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>三个指标族互相欺骗：归集率可被强制归集刷高，融资成本可被少融资刷低，收益率可被拉长久期刷高。</li>\n<li>有效归集率的分母必须扣除受限资金与成员最低经营留存，否则指标虚高且会引发成员体外开户。</li>\n<li>净额化比率直接反映归集消除了多少&quot;同时存款又借款&quot;的浪费，是结构选择的最终效果度量。</li>\n<li>新增融资决策应看边际成本而非平均成本；总资金成本须合并计算融资成本与闲置资金的机会成本。</li>\n<li>收益率归因区分配置、选择、时机三类效应，时机效应接近随机，不可作为能力证据。</li>\n<li>三指标必须联合判读；&quot;低归集率 + 高收益率&quot;是资金调度能力最差的组合。</li>\n<li>指标口径必须书面化并留痕，口径变更须重述历史，否则趋势不可比。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"资金归集率/融资成本/收益率度量","id":"资金归集率-融资成本-收益率度量"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"归集率的定义与陷阱","id":"归集率的定义与陷阱"},{"level":3,"text":"三个归集率口径","id":"三个归集率口径"},{"level":3,"text":"归集率的常见失真","id":"归集率的常见失真"},{"level":2,"text":"融资成本的度量","id":"融资成本的度量"},{"level":3,"text":"加权平均融资成本","id":"加权平均融资成本"},{"level":3,"text":"边际成本与平均成本","id":"边际成本与平均成本"},{"level":3,"text":"融资成本与流动性成本的合并","id":"融资成本与流动性成本的合并"},{"level":2,"text":"收益率的度量与归因","id":"收益率的度量与归因"},{"level":3,"text":"净贡献收益率","id":"净贡献收益率"},{"level":3,"text":"与流动性的联合判读","id":"与流动性的联合判读"},{"level":2,"text":"度量体系的运行要求","id":"度量体系的运行要求"},{"level":3,"text":"口径的一致性与可追溯","id":"口径的一致性与可追溯"},{"level":3,"text":"与其他体系的衔接","id":"与其他体系的衔接"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"流动性风险与应急额度","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/global-treasury-cash-pooling/treasury-risk-metric/liquidity-risk-contingency"},"next":null}